WEBVTT

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:07.650
It’s almost time, isn’t it?

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:09.980
I can’t wait!

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.120
I’m so excited.

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:15.690
You guys look like you’re having fun.

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:17.940
Is something good happening?

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:21.190
We’re having our
capping ceremony next week.

00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:23.630
What’s a capping ceremony?

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:27.240
It’ll be the first time we’ll get to wear the nurse’s cap.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:28.910
It’s a very important ceremony.

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:34.350
It is also symbolic of being acknowledged as nurses
before we begin our internships at the hospital.

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:36.920
I get it! It’s that, isn’t it?

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:38.540
Let’s see...

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:39.820
Angel of destruction!

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:42.130
The right way of saying it is
“white gowned angel”.

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:44.420
Oh, I’ve made another mistake.

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:47.980
But, that’s not all to look forward to.

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.600
What else is there?

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:55.500
It’s tradition in our university to receive flowers
from the male medical students after the ceremony.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.870
Naturally, from your boyfriend
or the guy you like.

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:04.650
How lovely! That sounds very romantic.

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:08.070
And naturally, you’ll be receiving flowers from Naoki, right, Kotoko?

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:16.720
You’re right! There they are, Taeko-chan and Miki-chan.

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:19.790
They’re all students from our class.

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:21.470
They’re all panicking.

00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:23.090
I see.

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:26.680
So that’s why everyone has been in such high spirits lately.

00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:29.680
That’s right. It’s just like Valentine’s.

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:33.520
There wouldn’t be any problems if the guy made the approach.

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:37.490
But, it’s a once-in-a-lifetime event after all, so everyone is taking it very seriously.

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:44.330
In that case, it must be my lucky day! I’m so happy.

00:01:45.140 --> 00:01:48.380
I can just imagine how wonderful it’ll be!

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:51.230
Congratulations, Kotoko.
It looks great on you.

00:01:51.230 --> 00:01:52.730
Irie-kun.

00:01:52.730 --> 00:01:55.840
I’ll be receiving flowers from him, won’t I?

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:58.700
She’s completely lost in her own world.

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:01.320
Ah! It’s Irie-kun!

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:04.700
What a great place to find you!

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:06.270
What is it?

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:09.920
You know about the upcoming capping ceremony, right?

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:13.610
The male medical students give flowers to the female nurses.

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:15.550
I’m so delighted.

00:02:15.550 --> 00:02:18.880
But, I feel kinda sad for the nurses who don’t have anyone they like in the medical department.

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:22.340
I’m so glad I have you
in the medical department.

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:25.470
I don’t care what kind of flowers I receive, but I think roses...

00:02:25.470 --> 00:02:26.430
It’s out of the question.

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:31.900
I’ll be attending an academic meeting in Nagoya with my lecturer on that day.

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:34.440
But...

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:37.980
Either way, I don’t feel like doing such an embarrassing act either.

00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:39.090
It’s stupid.

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:42.490
Stupid?

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:20.690
That’s too pitiful, Kotoko!

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:21.610
Pitiful?

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:25.950
But, Irie-san turned down all the other girls too, so...

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:26.990
So?

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:28.990
What are you trying to say, Tomoko?

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:31.870
Kotoko is his wife.

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.750
Yet he turned her down.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.960
It’s unbelievable, isn’t it?

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:39.710
His wife, yet he turned her down?

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:43.760
Would you guys cut it out?

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:48.300
Your husband is currently doing his internship at the hospital, right?

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:51.230
He has his own problems and can’t take things easy.

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:53.970
As his wife, you should at least understand that much.

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:55.910
He’s completely right...

00:04:57.890 --> 00:05:00.410
Keita is actually siding with Irie-san.

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:02.320
That’s rather surprising.

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:10.240
Keita!

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:12.370
What?

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:15.340
Heartbreak makes a man
more mature, doesn’t it?

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:16.910
Sheesh, stop clinging on to me.

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:19.930
Good to see you’ve gotten over it.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.090
Oh, shut up.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.880
The lecture is about to start. Let’s go.

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:25.050
Right.

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:32.350
I’m the head nurse of Tonan University Hospital, Hosoi Sayuri.

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:33.640
Nice to meet you all.

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:36.190
Note: Hosoi = Slender
Hosoi-san?

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:40.190
I’ve come here today to talk to you all about the capping ceremony.

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:45.070
First, for the Nightingale Pledge, I need to...

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:45.780
Yes!

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:48.000
Yes, yes!

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:50.980
...decide on a representative to recite the...

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:53.650
Yes, yes, Sensei!

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:55.360
...pledge during the ceremony.

00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:57.360
I’d like to do it!

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:01.880
You’re a boy, aren’t you?

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:03.280
Out of the question!

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:07.550
Unfortunately, for generations,

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:11.500
the representative has been a girl wearing a nurse cap emulating Miss Nightingale.

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:18.880
The boys will be receiving a handkerchief with the medical symbol, the rod of Asclepius.

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:21.050
No way!

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:23.890
Handkerchief?

00:06:24.470 --> 00:06:28.560
So then, would anyone else like to be the representative?

00:06:31.180 --> 00:06:33.480
I guess that leaves me no choice.

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:35.910
Irie Kotoko?

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:39.570
Is Irie-san here?

00:06:39.570 --> 00:06:41.070
Yes?

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:44.670
Are you the wife of Irie-san from the medical department by any chance?

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:46.840
Yeah, I guess...

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.490
As I thought!

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:50.790
Then, can you please do it?

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:53.560
You’re Irie-kun’s wife after all.

00:06:53.560 --> 00:06:57.290
You must be quite an accomplished student. I have high hopes for you.

00:06:58.210 --> 00:07:00.760
Things sure have turned out badly...

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:05.680
I can’t believe I’m the representative.

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:08.070
Even after you declared your intentions.

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:11.390
I was just joking around.

00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:14.770
Since no one wanted to represent, I just wanted to try saying it.

00:07:14.770 --> 00:07:17.080
Well, give it your best shot, Kotoko.

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:19.880
I’ll try...

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:29.390
Isn’t that great, Kotoko-chan? You were chosen to be the representative for the ceremony.

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:31.550
Yeah...

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:34.380
Come on, Onii-chan.
Are you sure you can’t attend?

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:37.350
It’s an important occasion for Kotoko-chan.

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:40.400
I already told you that I’ll be staying overnight at Nagoya.

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:43.890
Is there any way you can mess up that academic meeting?

00:07:44.390 --> 00:07:45.330
Mother!

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:47.190
Hey, I can hear you!

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:52.240
Well, try not to embarrass yourself.

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:55.670
Even I know that.

00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:58.380
I know that it can’t be helped.

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:01.160
But, you didn’t have to say it like that.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:04.000
Irie-kun, you dummy.

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:12.980
...and all family affairs...

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:15.680
Uh, what comes after that?

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:18.320
All family affairs coming to my knowledge...

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:21.060
...in the practice of my calling.

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:27.080
I solemnly pledge myself before God and in the presence of this assembly...

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:31.080
Moto-chan is really amazing. How is he able to recite it so beautifully?

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:34.670
...and devote myself to the welfare of those committed to my care.

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:36.200
That’s great!

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:39.280
Sheesh. You still haven’t memorized it?

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:41.160
You’ve only got two days left.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:46.300
You were serious about becoming the representative, weren’t you?

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:55.630
When I was a kid, I saw a capping ceremony in an old foreign movie.

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:58.640
It was so pure and beautiful.

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:03.010
I also wanted to be granted the nurse cap...

00:09:03.010 --> 00:09:06.140
...and recite the Nightingale Pledge like that one day.

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:07.980
I’ve always wanted to.

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:09.110
Moto-chan...

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:12.440
But, I can’t do anything about it.

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:15.660
I wish I was born as a girl.

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:20.210
Moto-chan, it’s still too early to give up!

00:09:22.990 --> 00:09:27.410
The capping ceremony for the second-year students shall now commence.

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:40.360
Even the atmosphere feels so sacred.

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:43.820
I can tell that everyone is nervous.

00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:49.100
I pray that it all goes well.

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:54.150
Irie Kotoko.

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:55.860
Yes.

00:09:56.570 --> 00:10:02.800
Irie-kun, I feel like I’ve become a little closer to you.

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:07.580
Do your best, okay?

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:09.790
I will.

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:13.840
If possible, I wanted Irie-kun to see me in these clothes too.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:15.340
Ogura Tomoko.

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:16.340
Yes.

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:18.420
Kikyou Motoki.

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:19.420
Yes.

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:25.860
Why are you wearing that?!

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:30.520
Moto-chan?

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:31.810
It looks so good on him!

00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:33.810
Get changed right this instant!

00:10:33.810 --> 00:10:35.650
How dare you commit such an act during this sacred capping ceremony?

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:36.980
Please wait, Sensei!

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:39.860
Please let him.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:43.950
Moto-chan worked so hard just for this day.

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:47.950
Whether you’re a man or a woman, it’s all the same when it comes to caregiving.

00:10:47.950 --> 00:10:51.250
I’m certain Moto-chan will become a great nurse!

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:53.600
Please, grant him the cap!

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:56.500
Sensei, please, we’re asking you too.

00:10:56.500 --> 00:11:00.300
Please grant Moto-chan’s small wish.

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:02.300
You girls.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:03.840
Sensei.

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:07.810
Please put the nurse cap on Motoki.

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:09.730
I’ll pass on mine though.

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:11.020
Poor thing!

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:13.440
Please!

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:17.650
Very well then.

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:19.690
I’ll make an exception because of your enthusiasm.

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:23.200
As a special case, Kikyou-kun has my permission to receive the nurse cap.

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:25.840
Really?

00:11:25.840 --> 00:11:27.240
You did it!

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:28.830
Good for you, Moto-chan!

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:32.250
Thank you! It’s all because of you!

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:33.760
Thank you all too!

00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:36.080
I love you all!

00:11:54.850 --> 00:12:00.700
I solemnly pledge myself before God and in the presence of this assembly...

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:06.450
...to pass my life in purity and to practice my profession faithfully.

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:11.790
I will abstain from whatever is deleterious and mischievous...

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:17.670
...and will not take or knowingly administer any harmful drug.

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:26.310
I will do all in my power to maintain and elevate the standard of my profession...

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:32.270
...and will hold in confidence all personal matters committed to my keeping...

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:36.320
...and all family affairs coming to my knowledge in the practice of my calling.

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:38.520
Irie-kun, can you hear me?

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:39.310
...and all family affairs coming to my knowledge in the practice of my calling.

00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:44.320
I hope I can continue to be with you long into the future.

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:46.280
I’ll do my best.

00:12:52.740 --> 00:12:54.830
It was truly wonderful.

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:58.580
However, Irie-kun won’t be
coming home tonight.

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:00.420
I’ll stay a little longer...

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:04.260
Who’s there?

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:05.920
Dummy! It’s me.

00:13:09.840 --> 00:13:10.990
Irie-kun?

00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:14.310
Why? Weren’t you staying overnight?

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:16.990
I made the very last bullet train.

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.440
You came back for me?

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:23.370
But in the end,
I still failed to make the ceremony.

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:26.120
The florist was already closed too.

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:28.650
It’s okay. I don’t need such things.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.820
I’m just glad you came for me.

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:37.340
Let’s hear your recital.

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:45.220
With... With loyalty will I endeavor to aid the physician, in his work...

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:50.180
...and devote myself to the welfare of those committed to my care.

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:54.180
Once more.

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:59.520
With...

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:02.980
Dear God, dear Buddha,
dear Miss Nightingale...

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:06.280
...I shall never forget this day.

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:09.820
No matter what hardships I face in the future...

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:13.460
...I will remember today, and do my best.

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:23.220
It’s been four years since the emotional capping ceremony.

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:26.970
I’m now a fully qualified...

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:29.760
Please get out of the way!

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:32.270
Irie-san! You mustn’t run in the hallways!

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:34.880
Yes, ma’am!

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:40.010
Honestly! It’s a huge problem that you keep acting like a novice!

00:14:40.010 --> 00:14:41.940
This is already your second year here!

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:43.970
I’m sorry.

00:14:43.970 --> 00:14:46.850
So much for white-gowned angels...

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:51.450
I’m back.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:53.650
Irie-san, you’re late!

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:55.610
I’m sorry.

00:14:56.540 --> 00:15:00.910
Look, Yoshida-san from Room 502 is calling for a nurse.

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:02.870
Hurry!

00:15:02.870 --> 00:15:04.830
Yes! I’m going!

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:14.300
Did you call, Yoshida-san?

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:15.190
You’re late!

00:15:15.190 --> 00:15:19.180
I keep telling you to come within thirty seconds of my call!

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:20.840
That’s too much...

00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:23.680
I want some juice. Bring me some, please.

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:25.110
You can do that yourself.

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:29.560
How could you say that to a sick,
elderly woman?

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:32.480
I didn’t know such horrible nurses existed!

00:15:32.480 --> 00:15:35.150
Please don’t say such bad things about me.

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:37.440
I just have to go, right?

00:15:38.740 --> 00:15:41.610
Sheesh, I’m just an errand girl now.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:44.330
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:47.580
Excuse me.

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:50.580
Okay, breathe in.

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:52.060
Okay.

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:53.670
So it is Irie-kun!

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:57.460
Honestly, what an outrageous man.

00:15:57.460 --> 00:15:59.550
And you disregarded me too.

00:15:59.550 --> 00:16:02.010
Dr. Nishigaki?

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:03.570
You poor thing.

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:07.560
Why don’t you leave that cold-hearted husband of yours for me?

00:16:07.560 --> 00:16:08.980
Dr. Nishigaki.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:09.950
Irie-kun?

00:16:09.950 --> 00:16:13.020
These are Kagayama-san’s medical records for this afternoon’s surgery.

00:16:13.020 --> 00:16:14.900
Ah, I see.

00:16:14.900 --> 00:16:17.320
You’ll be my assistant.

00:16:17.320 --> 00:16:18.780
Prep it for me.

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:19.960
Very well.

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:22.420
Sheesh, can’t even take a joke.

00:16:23.740 --> 00:16:26.580
Dr. Nishigaki is always like that.

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:29.330
He’s the type that would go for any kind of woman.

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:34.210
That hurts. You’re terrible!

00:16:34.790 --> 00:16:37.800
You don’t even know how to massage shoulders properly.

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:40.520
Are you really a qualified nurse?

00:16:41.470 --> 00:16:44.570
What did you just say?

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:47.180
Though it’s nothing to be proud of...

00:16:47.180 --> 00:16:50.560
...but I passed the state examination on my first try!

00:16:50.560 --> 00:16:54.020
What the? No one ever asked you that.

00:16:54.020 --> 00:16:57.520
It was really tough studying for it.

00:16:57.520 --> 00:17:01.500
But, thanks to Irie-kun’s strict yet gentle guidance...

00:17:02.030 --> 00:17:06.570
Dr. Irie must have lost his mind when he married someone like you.

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:11.210
Irie-kun’s photos, doctor version!

00:17:12.160 --> 00:17:16.040
If only I were fifty years younger.

00:17:16.040 --> 00:17:20.670
Excuse me, Yoshida-san.
Can I look at them for a bit too?

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:21.710
No way.

00:17:22.260 --> 00:17:24.010
Come on, I’m only looking!

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:28.180
Hooray!

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:29.260
Irie-san.

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:32.820
Just what are you doing?
You’re being noisy.

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:34.850
Ah, no. It’s just...

00:17:34.850 --> 00:17:36.830
Nice timing.

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:42.700
Help me! This nurse is trying to steal my stuff!

00:17:43.650 --> 00:17:46.450
Ah, no! It’s a misunderstanding!

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:49.220
Irie-san. Come with me!

00:17:52.830 --> 00:17:56.580
Damn that two-faced old hag!

00:17:57.920 --> 00:17:59.310
Akiko-chan.

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:04.650
The doctor said that you’ll be able to walk with crutches soon.

00:18:05.840 --> 00:18:07.640
Your discharge will be soon too.

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:08.760
Aren’t you glad?

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:11.530
But then, Kamogari-san, we won’t be able to...

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:14.680
No, nothing.

00:18:17.350 --> 00:18:18.310
Akiko-chan!

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:23.190
That was quite a nice mood you two had there.

00:18:23.190 --> 00:18:24.110
Kotoko?

00:18:24.110 --> 00:18:25.740
Akiko-chan!

00:18:25.740 --> 00:18:26.610
Something like that.

00:18:26.610 --> 00:18:28.800
Idiot! What are you saying?

00:18:28.800 --> 00:18:31.330
So, you think nothing of her then?

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:35.000
Err, well. She is cute...

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:37.040
But, she’s still a high schooler.

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:39.750
Hey! She’s a patient!

00:18:39.750 --> 00:18:42.130
As her nurse, I’m merely doing my best to...

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:43.840
Keita, your face is red.

00:18:44.960 --> 00:18:48.010
Sheesh, he’s not honest with himself.

00:18:49.300 --> 00:18:50.220
I’m back.

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:53.220
Welcome back, Onii-chan.

00:18:53.220 --> 00:18:54.570
Hmm? Where’s Kotoko?

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:57.850
She mentioned something about writing a “perfect nurse plan”...

00:18:57.850 --> 00:18:59.730
...and she’s been in her room all this time.

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:01.580
I’m so bored.

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:22.960
Hey, guys! We’ve got a huge problem!

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:24.480
What is it? What happened?

00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:25.670
It’s Nobuhiro!

00:19:25.670 --> 00:19:28.550
I heard Nobuhiro just came from the internal medicine outpatient clinic!

00:19:29.630 --> 00:19:31.340
Nobuhiro did?!

00:19:31.340 --> 00:19:32.260
Who’s that?

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:36.220
Kotoko, what’s wrong with you?

00:19:36.220 --> 00:19:40.310
We’re obviously referring to Nobuhiro, the heartthrob, pretty boy model!

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:42.270
You really don’t know who he is?

00:19:42.270 --> 00:19:44.660
Is he really that famous?

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:46.320
Extremely.

00:19:46.320 --> 00:19:49.450
He’s a big star who’s been cast in the lead role of a movie!

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:54.170
Honestly. Your lack of interest in men other than Irie-san is too much.

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:56.450
But, even if you say that...

00:19:56.450 --> 00:20:00.040
We have to hurry! Nobuhiro might leave!

00:20:00.040 --> 00:20:01.180
You’re right!

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:03.880
Why are you dragging me along?!

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:07.650
Do you see him?

00:20:09.010 --> 00:20:11.010
He should really stand out if he’s here.

00:20:12.090 --> 00:20:14.400
Did we not make it in time?

00:20:15.680 --> 00:20:18.520
I even got the paper ready.

00:20:18.520 --> 00:20:20.390
How calculating.

00:20:20.390 --> 00:20:21.310
I can’t see.

00:20:22.230 --> 00:20:23.190
Move aside.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:26.940
Oh, the TV? Sorry.

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:31.380
Nobuhiro?!

00:20:31.380 --> 00:20:35.070
We’re huge fans of yours.

00:20:35.070 --> 00:20:37.200
We always check out your magazines.

00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:38.790
You’ll be starring in a movie next, right?

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:40.140
I’ll definitely go watch!

00:20:40.140 --> 00:20:42.370
May I have your autograph?

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:44.210
May I shake your hand then?

00:20:44.210 --> 00:20:44.960
No.

00:20:47.130 --> 00:20:50.770
I’m not working, so why do I have to do such things?

00:20:53.340 --> 00:20:54.900
What’s with this guy?

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:59.770
Besides, isn’t a hospital a place where sick people go to?

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:03.350
And the nurses dare ask sick people for autographs?

00:21:03.350 --> 00:21:04.520
Don’t you feel ashamed?

00:21:04.520 --> 00:21:07.900
Hey you! You don’t have to speak that way, do you?

00:21:07.900 --> 00:21:08.830
Kotoko!

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:11.860
We’re at fault too.

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:16.780
But, I don’t know how popular you are, but for a high schooler, you sure have some nerve.

00:21:16.780 --> 00:21:21.300
There’s a proper way to talk to your elders!

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:25.710
If you keep acting so vainly, you’ll have no future as a star...

00:21:25.710 --> 00:21:26.640
I missed you!

00:21:28.210 --> 00:21:29.340
Kotoko-san.

00:23:06.140 --> 00:23:07.770
What?

00:23:07.770 --> 00:23:09.140
I don’t know who he is.

00:23:09.140 --> 00:23:11.450
You don’t remember me? How cold.

00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:13.520
But, but...

00:23:13.520 --> 00:23:16.690
Hey, Kotoko-san, don’t tell me you became a nurse?

00:23:16.690 --> 00:23:19.280
I really hope you’re not
the nurse in-charge of me.

00:23:19.280 --> 00:23:23.200
Hey! Why do you have to say such things?!

00:23:23.200 --> 00:23:25.240
Just who are you?!

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:28.260
Next time on Itazura na Kiss:

00:23:28.260 --> 00:23:29.540
The glass boy.

00:23:29.540 --> 00:23:31.710
I’m definitely gonna be happy.
